    "result_text": "Full suite is green. \n\nThe change is complete. I implemented `timezone` on the owner response as a derived IANA name from the fixed region-to-timezone table:\n\n- **`openapi.yml`** \u2014 added a read-only `timezone` string field to the Owner response schema (so the generated `OwnerDto` gains the property), documenting the NSW\u2192Australia/Sydney, VIC\u2192Australia/Melbourne, QLD\u2192Australia/Brisbane mapping.\n- **`Localities.java`** \u2014 added the `REGION_TIMEZONE` lookup table and a `timezoneOf(customerCode, city, postcode)` method that derives the region via the existing `localityOf(...)` and maps it to the IANA name (returning `null` for `UNKNOWN`, mirroring how `locality` is derived).\n- **`OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 wired a `timezone` mapping expression calling `Localities.timezoneOf(...)`, alongside the existing `locality` mapping.\n\nThe new acceptance test `coreReturnsTimezoneForRegion` (Sydney/NSW \u2192 `Australia/Sydney`) and the full suite pass (`BUILD SUCCESS`).",
